    {
      "id": "between_the_buried_and_me-the_parallax_hypersleep_dialogues",
      "artist": "Between the Buried and Me",
      "album": "The Parallax: Hypersleep Dialogues",
      "year": 2011,
      "label": "Metal Blade",
      "genre": "Progressive Metal / Technical Death Metal",
      "runtime": "30:02",
      "review": "Three tracks, thirty minutes, and the clearest sign yet of where BTBAM were heading. The psychedelic edge that was always lurking beneath the surface gets more room here. Specular Reflection opens with an almost meditative patience before the band tears it apart. Augment of Rebirth is the centerpiece, shifting through more moods in ten minutes than most bands manage across an album. A lean, focused statement that made the wait for the second part genuinely excruciating.",
